{"t":"Travel Expenses (Book)","s":"travel-expenses-book-1c78d","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Document_Certificate_bb7072.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">To Captain Starbird, Port Hope, Juggling Mermaid's Inn.</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Document (Certificate)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Document_Certificate_bb7072.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>, in a chest <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32962,32430,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32962, 32430, 7)</a>.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pirate captain Jack Rumgut has left fellow captain Rodney Starbird a note concerning the latter's savings.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Jack Rumgut</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedpages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related Articles</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/quest/small-sapphire-quest\">Small Sapphire Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Pirates\">Pirates</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Drefia Library.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.10<br/>July 17, 2013<br/>Summer Update 2013 Part 1</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Contrary to how it may seem, you can simply walk over to the island the chest containing this document is located on.Obtained during the <a href=\"#/quest/small-sapphire-quest\">Small Sapphire Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/>To Captain Starbird, Port Hope, Juggling Mermaid's Inn.<br/><br/>Rodney, ye hairy ol' walrus, I hope this finds ye in good health and spirits and a fair maiden in each arm, too, I wager.<br/> As we had to scarper from that last and somewhat heated appointment with the fleet, I took the liberty of deducting my travel expenses from the contents of this here treasure chest. Shiver me timbers, what a blow my ol' Red Ruby took! It's three months' repair at least before venturing out for the next likely booty for us.<br/>Well, take the rest for a merry round of quaffing with the boys, and we'll meet at the usual place at the usual time.<br/><br/>Yohoho,<br/><br/>Captain Jack Rumgut</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["small-sapphire-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"small-sapphire-quest","quest":"Small Sapphire Quest","kind":"reward"}],"spots":[{"x":32962,"y":32430,"z":7,"text":"Drefia , in a chest here ."}]}}